- An AWS IAM role trusted by Amazon Redshift
- An IAM policy attachment giving the role read-only access to S3
- A VPC with two subnets for the Redshift cluster
- A security group for Redshift
- A Redshift subnet group
- A single-node Amazon Redshift cluster
- Association of the IAM role with the Redshift cluster

